        "Frontend state decoupling — refactor 800+ line monolithic React components into clean domain boundaries with memoized hooks to eliminate laggy re-renders.",
        "Error boundaries & fallback states — when an upstream AI model hits high latency or a 504, your app should retry gracefully and show a friendly fallback, not a blank white screen.",
        "Database indexing & query analysis — run EXPLAIN ANALYZE on all foreign-key lookups and sorting queries. AI generators rarely create the composite indexes you need.",
        "Structured logging & error tracking — replace console.log with centralized telemetry (Sentry, PostHog, or Datadog) to track exceptions and latency in real time.",
